        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma nubwo yakwasire omulinga yagwagya, yagukoramu etanka erukusisana enyamuziga, emikono ikumi okuruga ha mugoma ogumu okuhika ha mugoma ogundi, obura bwayo emikono etaano, omuzimbo gwayo, neeyehingulirizibwa orukoba orw'emikono amakumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hansi y'omugoma, hakaba haroho ebisisani eby'endeku ebirukuhikya emikono amakumi asatu; okwehinguliriza etanka yoona. Ebisisani ebi, bikaba biri omu nkarra ibiri, byagiibwe hamu n'etanka, ha kiro eki yayagibweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etanka egi yayemerraga ha bisisani by'enimi ikumi na ibiri, isatu iroleriire ha bukiizi obw'emoso, isatu iroleriire Bugwaizooba, isatu ha bukiizi obw'obulyo, isatu ezindi iroleriire Burugaizooba; ebibunu byazo birorangaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuzimbo gwayo, rukaba ruli rutambo rumu; omugoma gwayo gukakorwa nk'omugoma gw'ekikopo, nk'ekyakyo ky'Iranga; yagiibwamuga entugiro enkumi ibiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akakora entebe ikumi ez'omulinga; buli emu obura bwayo emikono ena; obugazi emikono ena, kandi obwemi emikono esatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entebe ezi zikakorwa ziti: Zikaba ziina ebiremu, kandi ebiremu ebi, byasomekwaga omu mbaaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ha biremu ebi ebikaba bisomekerwe omu mbaaho, hakaba haroho ebisisani by'entale, eby'ente, n'ebya bakerubbi. Ha mbaaho ezi, ezikaba ziri hansi n'eruguru ey'ebisisani by'entale, n'eby'ente, hakaba haroho ekondo ezikozirwe kurungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi buli ntebe, ekaba ina enyamuziga ina ez'omulinga, n'ebyoma ebirukwebirigirwaho enyamuziga ezi, nabyo by'omulinga; kandi ha mbaju ina, hakaba haliyo ekintu eky'okuteekwamu ebbeseni. Ebintu ebi, bikaheesirwa hamu n'ekondo, ha rubaju orwa buli nyamuziga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunwa gwayo gukaba guli omunda y'ekondo, eyekaba neehikya oburaiha obw'omukono gumu gwekulingiriire, nk'okuguru kw'emeeza, guraihire omukono gumu n'ekicweka. Ha munwa gwayo aho, hakaba hasarwirweho, kandi ebiremu byayo, nibinganaingana ha mbaju ina, guteekulingiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyamuziga ina ezi zikaba ziri hansi y'ebiremu; ebyoma ebi zaayezigisirahoga, bikaba biheesirainwe ha kintu kimu n'entebe; obwemi obwa buli nyamuziga, omukono gumu n'ekicweka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyamuziga ezi ikakorwa nk'enyamuziga ez'ekigaali; ebyoma byazo eby'okwebirigiraho, emigoma yazo, empagi zaazo, n'enkundi zaazo, byona bikaba biri by'omulinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mbaju ina eza buli ntebe, hakaba haliyo ebintu eby'okuhagika; ebintu ebi bikakorwa ha kintu kimu n'entebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi haruguru eya buli ntebe, hakaba haroho ekintu ekyekulingiriire, obura bwakyo, ekicweka ky'omukono; kandi ha ntebe eruguru, enyomyo zaayo n'ebiremu byayo, bikakorwa ha kintu kimu n'eky'entebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumaiso g'enyomyo zaayo n'ag'ebiremu byazo, akasarurayo: ebisisani bya bakerubbi, eby'entale, n'eby'emikindo, naarorra ha mwanya ogwa buli kimu, yayehingulirizaaho ebyakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo yakozire ati entebe ikumi; zoona ikakorwa omu mulingo gumu, z'orulengo rumu, z'ensisana emu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
