        {
          "text": "Solomooni nukwo yakozire ati, ebikwato byona eby'omunju ya MUKAMA: Itambiro ery'ezaabbu, emeza ey'ezaabbu eyateebwahoga omugaati ogwahongerwaga MUKAMA. ",
